        title: "Precaution card for a school team",
        task: "Write a one-page safety and activity guide for a school team serving three students: a 7-year-old with DMD, a 9-year-old with L4 myelomeningocele and a VP shunt, and a 12-year-old with Down syndrome joining PE. For each, list the warning signs that require immediate referral, activity recommendations, and activities to avoid.",
        deliverable: "One-page table (condition, warning signs, recommended activity, avoid) written for teachers and aides."
